# Linux 移植规范：仓库内文本统一 LF，防止 CRLF 污染 Linux 构建与配置。
# 二进制资源显式标记，避免被文本归一化破坏。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.zip binary
*.cbz binary
*.exe binary
*.msi binary
*.deb binary
*.rpm binary
*.AppImage binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary

# GitHub Languages：让公开语言统计聚焦随包产品源码，而不是工程脚本与测试。
/scripts/** linguist-detectable=false
/tests/** linguist-detectable=false
/docs/** linguist-documentation
/public/demo/** linguist-documentation
/package-lock.json linguist-generated
/src-tauri/Cargo.lock linguist-generated
